<title>JAPAN: Sawako Corp plans share split.</title>
<headline>Sawako Corp plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sawako Corporation said on Monday it planned a 1.25-for-1 share split on September 19, for shareholders as of July 31.</p>
</text>
